s, understand documents, images, code, and spreadsheets, create new files, and run command-line tools for more advanced tasks.","proTask_firstMeet_intro_privacyNotice_web":"When you run tasks in Task Mode, Doubao may temporarily use the current browser to access certain websites and perform actions (such as clicking and inputting) on your behalf. Some actions (such as login and account security verification) may still require you to take over as prompted. Use with caution as AI may make mistakes. Doubao only interacts with pages as necessary to complete the task. All actions taken during the task are displayed in real time in the task interface, and you can stop the task at any time.\\nTo improve task execution efficiency and user experience, when you use the desktop app, Doubao may automatically access certain websites that require login using locally cached browser cookies to perform actions, provided you have recently logged in with Doubao Browser and the cookies have not expired. The cookies are only used locally. If you don\'t want Doubao to access websites directly with login credentials, you can stop the current task or clear browser cookies in the browser menu by clicking \\"Delete Browsing Data > Cookies and other site data > Delete data\\". After clearing cookies, you need to log in to the websites manually when required. \\nWhen you use the web app, you can enable Autosave Cookies in Pro Model under Settings to automatically use cached cookies for improved experience. After enabling it, you can disable autosave and clear cookies at any time.","local_file.ask_human.ask.description":"Answer the questions below so Doubao can continue the task.","local_file.ask_human.warn.description":"Once you allow it, Doubao will perform the following high-risk actions.","infra_toast_switchedToWork":"Switched to Work Mode","dispatch_office_task_mode_settings_cn":"Work Mode","proTask_introCard_privacyNotice_desktop":"When you run tasks in Task Mode, Doubao may temporarily use the current browser to access certain websites and perform actions (such as clicking and inputting) on your behalf. Some actions (such as login and account security verification) may still require you to take over as prompted. Use with caution as AI may make mistakes. Doubao only interacts with pages as necessary to complete the task. All actions taken during the task are displayed in real time in the task interface, and you can stop the task at any time.\\nTo improve task execution efficiency and user experience, when you use the desktop app, Doubao may automatically access certain websites that require login using locally cached browser cookies to perform actions, provided you have recently logged in with Doubao Browser and the cookies have not expired. The cookies are only used locally. If you don\'t want Doubao to access websites directly with login credentials, you can stop the current task or clear browser cookies in the browser menu by clicking \\"Delete Browsing Data > Cookies and other site data > Delete data\\". After clearing cookies, you need to log in to the websites manually when required. \\nWhen you use the web app, you can enable Autosave Cookies in Task Mode under Settings to automatically use cached cookies for improved experience. After enabling it, you can disable autosave and clear cookies at any time.","interaction_warn":"Allow Doubao to perform this action?","moaFE_askHuman_allowAction":"Allow Doubao to perform this action?","inputBox_placeholder_messageSkillFile":"Message, / for skills, @ for files","cua_file_auth_desc":"This includes all files and subfolders in this folder. Doubao will be able to read, edit, and permanently delete them, so avoid sharing sensitive info.","local_file_ask_human_request_action_notification_title":"Doubao needs your help","interaction_authorize_folder":"Allow Doubao to edit this folder?","browser_user_tools.browser_download_url.description":"Download tool! The download tool is not a storage tool and must not be used interchangeably. It may only be used when the user explicitly mentions the word \'\'download\'\'. It is not useful for final report generation and must not be misused. This tool is strictly for downloading files to the user\'\'s local device; downloaded content will NOT be used in final HTML generation. If you need to store images for product generation, use the \'\'add pic memo\'\' tool instead. It is prohibited to open or download browser internal pages with the chrome: or doubao: protocol. Important: image URLs may not end in .png or .jpg; the full URL including any trailing search parameters must be preserved, otherwise the image cannot be accessed.","browser_user_tools.browser_download_url.param_url":"URL of the file to download, do not use chrome: or doubao: protocol URLs","browser_user_tools.browser_input.description":"Overwrite text in editable elements on the current browser page. Use when filling content in input fields. Do not enter browser-internal chrome: or doubao: URLs.","browser_user_tools.browser_input.param_text":"Complete text content to overwrite. Do not use browser-internal chrome: or doubao: URLs.","browser_user_tools.browser_link_reader.description":"Open this page and read its content. This tool is not the primary choice; it should only be used when another LinkReader tool cannot read the page (e.g., Xiaohongshu, Zhihu, where a standard LinkReader may fail). In such cases, this tool can be used as a fallback to read the page content. It is prohibited to open browser internal pages using chrome: or doubao: protocol URLs.","browser_user_tools.browser_link_reader.param_url":"URL of the page to be read; do not use chrome: or doubao: protocol URLs.","browser_user_tools.browser_navigate.description":"Open a webpage. It is forbidden to open the browser internal page of chrome: or doubao: protocol.","browser_user_tools.browser_navigate.input_schema_description":"Open a webpage. It is forbidden to open the browser internal page of chrome: or doubao: protocol.","browser_user_tools.browser_navigate.param_url":"Complete URL to visit. Must include protocol prefix. Do not use browser-internal chrome: or doubao: URLs.","browser_user_tools.browser_v2_open_url_in_browser.description":"Open the specified URL or local file in the GUI browser and return a screenshot after the page has finished loading. It is prohibited to open browser internal pages using the chrome: or doubao: protocol.","browser_user_tools.browser_v2_open_url_in_browser.param_url":"Resource to open. This can be an HTTP/HTTPS URL or a local file path. Do not use URLs with the chrome: or doubao: protocol.","browser_user_tools.browser_v2_type.description":"Enter text at the current focus position. To submit, append \\n at the end of the content to trigger Enter. It is prohibited to input browser internal page URLs using the chrome: or doubao: protocol.","browser_user_tools.browser_v2_type.param_content":"Text to be entered. Appending \\n at the end will trigger a single Enter submission. Do not input URLs using the chrome: or doubao: protocol.","browser_user_tools.doubao_pc_input.description":"This tool can simulate a user typing text at a specified location on the current virtual machine browser page. It is prohibited to input browser internal page URLs using the chrome: or doubao: protocol.","browser_user_tools.doubao_pc_input.param_text":"Text content to be entered. Do not input URLs using the chrome: or doubao: protocol.","browser_user_tools.doubao_pc_navigate.description":"This tool can open a specified URL in a virtual machine browser and capture a screenshot of the current window with interactive elements highlighted. It is prohibited to open browser internal pages using the chrome: or doubao: protocol.","browser_user_tools.doubao_pc_navigate.param_url":"Complete web URL (including https:// protocol header). Do not use chrome: or doubao: protocol URLs.","moaFE_askHuman_allowFolderModify":"Allow Doubao to modify this folder?","infra_toast_switchedToPro":"Switched to Work Mode","cua_file_auth_desc_global":"Dola will be able to read, edit, and permanently delete content in all files and subfolders in it. Avoid sharing sensitive information.","local_agent_download_pc_v2_global":"Download Dola desktop app\\nUnlock local tasks","local_agent_description_pc_global":"On desktop, Dola can work directly on your computer. It can access files in folders you\'ve authorized, understand local documents, images, code, spreadsheets, and other content, organize folders, manage files, create documents, and perform more advanced tasks using the command line and built-in tools.","dispatch_mobile_app_connect_computer_guide_global":"Log in to the same account on the Dola mobile app and desktop app. Then select a computer to start a chat.","dispatch_office_task_mode_settings_global":"Work Mode","dispatch_open_desktop_doubao_on_this_device_global":"Check that your computer is online and the Dola desktop app is connected","dispatch_open_mobile_doubao_to_connect_global":"Open Dola mobile app to connect","dispatch_requires_newer_desktop_doubao_upgrade_global":"Update Dola desktop app to use this feature","dispatch_same_account_device_control_permission_warn_global":"Dola will be able to read, edit, and permanently delete files and folders on this computer and on other devices logged in to the same account. Avoid sharing sensitive information.","dispatch_scan_qr_download_or_open_mobile_global":"Scan the QR code to download or open the Dola mobile app.","local_agent_global":"Run tasks on your local computer in Work Mode","local_agent_description_global":"On desktop, Dola can work directly on your computer. Once you authorize a folder, it can read and organize files, understand documents, images, code, and spreadsheets, create new files, and run command-line tools for more advanced tasks.","local_file.ask_human.ask.description_global":"Answer the following question to continue the task","local_file.ask_human.warn.description_global":"Once allowed, Dola can perform the following high-risk action:","proTask_introCard_privacyNotice_desktop_global":"When you run tasks in Work Mode, Dola may temporarily use your current browser to access websites and perform actions on your behalf, such as clicking buttons and entering text. Some actions, including logging in and completing security verification, still require your approval or manual input. AI can make mistakes, so use Work Mode with care. Dola only interacts with webpages when necessary to complete your task. You can monitor all actions in real time from the task interface and stop the task at any time. To improve task execution and provide a smoother experience, the desktop app can automatically access certain websites using browser cookies stored locally on your device, provided you have recently logged in with Dola Browser and the cookies are still valid. Cookies are used only on your device. If you don\'t want Dola to access logged-in websites automatically, you can stop the current task or clear your browser cookies by selecting Delete Browsing Data > Cookies and other site data > Delete data. After clearing your cookies, you\'ll need to log in to websites manually when prompted. When using the web app, you can turn on Autosave Cookies in Work Mode under Privacy and Permissions in Settings to allow Dola to use cached cookies for a smoother experience. You can turn it off and clear your saved cookies at any time.","proTask_firstMeet_intro_privacyNotice_web_global":"When you run tasks in Work Mode, Dola may temporarily use your current browser to access websites and perform actions on your behalf, such as clicking buttons and entering text. Some actions, including logging in and completing security verification, still require your approval or manual input. AI can make mistakes, so use Work Mode with care. Dola only interacts with webpages when necessary to complete your task. You can monitor all actions in real time from the task interface and st